# Domain Constants Conventions

- Classes must be `public`.
- Class names must end with the suffix `Constants` (e.g. `AppointmentTypeConstants`).
- Must reside in the `*.Domain.Constants` namespace matching the folder path.

```csharp
// GOOD
namespace ClinicManagement.Domain.Constants;

public static class AppointmentTypeConstants
{
    public const int MaxNameLength = 100;
}
```

```csharp
// BAD — wrong suffix, wrong visibility
namespace ClinicManagement.Domain.Constants;

internal static class AppointmentTypes { }
```
